
dock load
  load <node:os>, name os

task get
  take kind, like text
  fork roll
    hook is-home
      call eq
        bind a, read kind
        bind b, text <home>
      send back, call os/homedir
    hook is-temporary
      call eq
        bind a, read kind
        bind b, text <temporary>
      send back, call os/tmpdir
    hook is-hostname
      call eq
        bind a, read kind
        bind b, text <hostname>
      send back, call os/hostname
    hook is-platform
      call eq
        bind a, read kind
        bind b, text <platform>
      send back, call os/platform
    hook is-arch
      call eq
        bind a, read kind
        bind b, text <arch>
      send back, call os/arch
    hook fallback
      send back, text <unknown>
